{"available":true,"compare_at_price_max":0,"compare_at_price_min":0,"compare_at_price_varies":false,"compare_at_price":0,"content":null,"description":"B\u00ECnh T\u1EE9 Linh v\u1EDBi h\u1ECDa ti\u1EBFt l\u00E0 h\u00ECnh d\u00E1ng c\u1EE7a c\u00E1c linh v\u1EADt c\u00F3 \u00FD ngh\u0129a t\u1ED1t l\u00E0nh, may m\u1EAFn, \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u1ED9i ng\u0169 ngh\u1EC7 nh\u00E2n c\u1EE7a Minh Long I ph\u00E1c h\u1ECDa t\u1EC9 m\u1EC9, kh\u00E9o l\u00E9o. T\u1EEBng b\u1ED9 ph\u1EADn \u0111\u1EBFn c\u00E1c chi ti\u1EBFt nh\u1ECF nh\u1EA5t c\u1EE7a linh v\u1EADt \u0111\u1EC1u \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u0111\u1EB7c t\u1EA3 sinh \u0111\u1ED9ng b\u1EB1ng n\u00E9t v\u1EBD uy\u1EC3n chuy\u1EC3n, d\u00E1ng di chuy\u1EC3n v\u1EDBi th\u1EA7n th\u00E1i linh ho\u1EA1t. T\u00E1c ph\u1EA9m v\u1EEBa mang n\u00E9t truy\u1EC1n th\u1ED1ng nh\u1EDD c\u00E1ch s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng m\u00E0u xanh blue Hu\u1EBF \u0111\u1EB7c tr\u01B0ng, v\u1EEBa sang tr\u1ECDng t\u1EEB nh\u1EEFng n\u00E9t v\u1EBD v\u00E0ng tr\u00EAn nhi\u1EC1u h\u1ECDa ti\u1EBFt.","featured_image":"https://cdn.hstatic.net/products/200000532849/binh-hoa-50-cm-binh-hoa-tu-linh_115054074-sm-01_8282afb17e6e423aa0a70d05adfd2ae3.png","handle":"binh-hoa-50-cm-binh-hoa-tu-linh","id":1070579715,"images":["https://cdn.hstatic.net/products/200000532849/binh-hoa-50-cm-binh-hoa-tu-linh_115054074-sm-01_8282afb17e6e423aa0a70d05adfd2ae3.png","https://cdn.hstatic.net/products/200000532849/binh-hoa-50-cm-binh-hoa-tu-linh_115054074-sm-02_bd59fa1e0fb44ce29f587eabe81308aa.png"],"media":[{"alt":null,"id":1628224524,"position":1,"preview_image":{"src":"https://cdn.hstatic.net/products/200000532849/binh-hoa-50-cm-binh-hoa-tu-linh_115054074-sm-01_8282afb17e6e423aa0a70d05adfd2ae3.png"},"external_id":null,"host":null,"media_type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hstatic.net/products/200000532849/binh-hoa-50-cm-binh-hoa-tu-linh_115054074-sm-01_8282afb17e6e423aa0a70d05adfd2ae3.png"},{"alt":null,"id":1628224547,"position":2,"preview_image":{"src":"https://cdn.hsta